Dear Applicants,

We are pleased to announce that the BS Environmental and Sanitary Engineeri=
ng, BS Electrical Engineering, BS Electronics Engineering, and BS Computer =
Engineering programs are now open for students from different academic stra=
nds who have achieved a General Weighted Average (GWA) of 85% and above.

Moreover, the BS Mechanical Engineering program is opening its doors to all=
 the students from different academic strands who have attained a General W=
eighted Average (GWA) of 90% and above.

Limited slots are available, enroll now to secure your enrollment slot! Ple=
ase prepare PHP6,100 for the enrollment downpayment. We also offer a 10% di=
scount for full cash payments.

To move forward to STEP no. 4 or Admissions Approval, please visit the enro=
llment hub (11th floor of the NU Annex Building) to complete your enrollmen=
t process.

Kindly bring all the necessary enrollment requirements such as:

  *
Original and Complete Grade 12 Report Card (we also accept those with incom=
plete grades)
  *
Certificate of Good Moral Character
  *
Original PSA-Authenticated Birth Certificate
  *
Recent two (2) pieces of 2x2 Colored ID pictures
  *
Chest X-ray Result

*Kindly disregard this email if you are already enrolled.

Thank you and warm regards,


Admissions Office
National University
